  "$Comment": "Tomas the Miller's winter look for Christmas, every piece of it the game's own: the same player's body, square face, moustache and short hair as his Harvest Feast look (Models/Harvest_Feast/NPC/Harvest_Feast_Miller.json), now under a bulky green beanie, the character creator's star sweater dyed red over his peasant shirt, a green scarf, his baggy work trousers and heavy work boots. Parent Seasons_Of_Orbis_Villager brings the player's body, its animations and its hitbox, and the wave he greets a player with. The body, face, mouth and ears share one skin tone (GradientSet Skin, GradientId 08): keep it the same as his feast look, so he reads as one man in two seasons. DefaultAttachments replaces the parent's list whole, so the face pieces come first. Under a hat the character creator swaps a haircut for its generic one (HaircutFallbacks), so the hair here is GenericShort. A greyscale texture takes its colour from GradientSet and GradientId, the dyes the character creator offers players: change a GradientId to re-dye one piece. The role Christmas_Miller names this model, and his placement wears that role while only Christmas runs.",
